Subject: [PATCH] Restore whole original async-loading source ownership

Upstream-base: f1e9646a7da6950143e77b1daed33a92c931a638
Prepared-preimage: exact reviewed strict-source199

Restore the complete matching AsyncLoading TU and original stage/sequence
methods, globals and persistent requirements. Legacy extracted diagnostics
are explicitly selected; the default FixedUpdate TU retains its actual
original empty marker providers. Native clock and event owner address
transport use the real existing canonical hardware/event ABI. Numeric
audio key pointers preserve Wii32 width on LP64 and LLP64.
No game sequence, source service case, yield/undo decision, load flags,
resource request or music readiness is changed. Interpreter serialized
layout/32-bit address words and audio registry payloads remain unqualified
runtime prerequisites; whole-source compilation is not original boot.

